  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "When I enter a world with a generic avatar, I can't take the objects with the pickup. I did various tests, go to different worlds and the result is always the same. To go into more detail, after entering world and change it in a humanoid avatar I can take the objects, and if I change again into a generic avatar I can also take the objects. If I enter a world with a generic avatar and change it to another generic one I can't pick up objects. While if I enter a world with a humanoid avatar and then change in generic the problem does not occur, to put it simply, the problem occurs only if you access the world with a generic avatar and not changing the avatar to an humanoid one. If necessary, I can record a short video to better show the problem\n\nEDIT: I forgot to specify that I'm playing from desktop",
